# Copy to .env.local and adjust. Every value is optional in development; the
# defaults are what the site ships with.
#
# There is deliberately no API origin here. The deployed site is static and
# reads its data from bundled modules under src/data. There is no server to
# point at, and no request is made for incidents, fact-checks, sources or
# reports. A VITE_API_URL would be read by nothing.

# Canonical site origin, used for share links and sitemap output.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://civic-sense-website.vercel.app

# Feature switches. Set any to "false" to remove a surface entirely: its card,
# its navigation link and its route all stop.
# VITE_FEATURE_FACTCHECK=false
# VITE_FEATURE_POLITICIANS=false
# VITE_FEATURE_MAP=false
# VITE_FEATURE_FEED=false
# VITE_FEATURE_REPORTS=false

# Admin access.
#
# There is none. The admin pages, the admin layout, the auth service and the
# /admin routes were all removed rather than password-gated, because a
# client-side password is not an access control: the moderation endpoints behind
# them had no server-side authentication, so the password only hid a URL that
# the browser could read straight from the bundle.
#
# Reports are stored in the visitor's own localStorage and are never
# transmitted. Nothing needs authenticating.